<title>UK: Halifax sets 2.0 bln ffr 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>Halifax sets 2.0 bln ffr 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CDC.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HALIFAX PLC</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    14.AUG.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.311   PAY DATE    14.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.686    SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EURO NOTE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
